{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "day": 2, "kind": "day_attempt", "clicked": "星河", "overlay": true, "presence": {"film_lion": ["luk_baakyin", "mak_zhendong"], "cafe_cha": ["liu_bingxing"], "film_harbour": ["ngai_wingnaam"], "tvb_longmen": ["pang_siuki", "chai_zanhoi"], "rec_star": ["chung_choning"], "tvb_harbour": ["gu_mingfai"], "rec_wanchai": ["so_jiyan"]}, "wf4": false}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 0, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "坐低啦，唔使企。今日冇咁趕，我哋慢慢傾。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "台慶爭位嗰啲事，外面傳到亂晒，我信得過你先同你講幾句真嘅。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "齊生你肯講，我就肯聽，聽完唔會周圍唱。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "後生仔，企位記熟未？臨時演員都要有臨時演員嘅樣。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "阿偉，今日呢啲說話，我冇同第二個人講過。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_shy.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "後生嗰班追到好貼，個個識打識跳，鏡頭又鍾意佢哋嗰種新鮮感。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "齊生，你嘅戲，唔係後生仔學幾下就學得嚟㗎。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "我知。但台入面開會，已經有人問，古裝戲仲係唔係台柱嗰味嘢。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "以前一講古裝，監製第一個就諗起我。而家佢哋諗嘅，係點樣慳皮、點樣捧新人。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "齊鎮海望住古裝街嗰道城門，嗰度佢企過無數次，今日望落去，眼神有啲唔同。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "我唔怕辛苦，我怕嘅係，有一日我企返去嗰個位，已經冇人覺得嗰個位係我嘅。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 11, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "轉型？我呢個年紀，嗰身打法、嗰種聲線，觀眾認咗咁多年，話變就變，變到似咩？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 12, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你係驚變咗，舊觀眾唔認你；唔變，新觀眾又唔埋嚟？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 13, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "你講中晒。我夜晚返到屋企，Call機靜晒，一個人對住劇本，就會諗呢樣嘢。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 14, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "一哥呢兩個字，聽落好威，實際上係企喺懸崖邊，後面仲要保持笑容。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 15, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "齊生，你肯同我講呢啲，我唔會當係八卦聽。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 16, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "我知你唔會。所以我先想聽你一句真話，你覺得我應該點行？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 17, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "……", "choices": ["講真話：戲路要變，唔變先危險", "安慰佢：一哥地位邊有咁易動搖"]}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 18, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "齊生，你諗多喇，一哥地位邊有咁易動搖呀，台入面邊個唔敬你三分？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 19, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "你係好意，我知。不過安慰說話我聽咗幾十年喇，分得出邊句係真，邊句係就我。", "choices": []}
