{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "day": 2, "kind": "day_attempt", "clicked": "星河", "overlay": true, "presence": {"film_lion": ["luk_baakyin", "mak_zhendong"], "cafe_cha": ["liu_bingxing"], "film_harbour": ["ngai_wingnaam"], "tvb_longmen": ["pang_siuki", "chai_zanhoi"], "rec_star": ["chung_choning"], "tvb_harbour": ["gu_mingfai"], "rec_wanchai": ["so_jiyan"]}, "wf4": false}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 0, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_shy.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "阿偉，嚟得啱喇，陪我行去化妝間，邊行邊講。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 1, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "電視城啲人事，表面靜，底下日日都喺度轉，你有冇聽到啲風聲？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 2, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "有啲聽過吓，不過唔敢亂講，想聽你點睇真啲。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "後生仔，企位記熟未？臨時演員都要有臨時演員嘅樣。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "阿偉，你坐低，我同你講吓電視城啲人事，你聽完自己諗，唔好周圍傳。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_smile.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "台慶爭位，年年都爭，今年特別勁，邊個企前排、邊個壓軸出場，監製開咗幾次會都未定到。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "有幾個後生今年劇集收得，聲勢上嚟得好快，台入面有人想順勢捧佢哋上嚟，呢個係事實，唔使妒忌。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "咁海港廣播嗰邊呢？聽講佢哋密密挖角，開到好高條件。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "海港嗰邊手勢係咁，邊個約就滿就搵邊個，九龍電視台都唔執輸，三家台而家係搶人搶到出面。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_serious.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "但你記住，走嘅人未必係貪錢，有啲係喺舊台企咗咁多年，都冇一個好角色，焗住要搏一次。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_think.webp", "name": "齊鎮海", "line": "留低嘅亦唔一定係忠心，可能係驚去到新台冇位企。邊個會走邊個會留，要睇佢最近接咩戲，唔好睇佢把口。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_chai_beats", "attempt": 0, "step": 11, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "chai_zanhoi_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你睇得咁通透，難怪邊個想郁你個位都郁唔到。", "choices": []}
